  "id": "conversational-repair",
  "term": "conversational repair",
  "definition": "Conversational repair is the back-and-forth people use to deal with misunderstanding in an interaction so they can keep or restore shared understanding. It reflects how meaning is worked out together when something said is unclear, misheard, or interpreted differently.",
